MDEON Ultra-Lightweight Desktop Shell (Zero-Toolkit Edition)
- Rendering: Pure PyCairo + Native librsvg / GdkPixbuf (Zero GTK/Qt GUI widgets)
- Freedesktop (XDG) Icon Theme Specification matching GTK4/Xfce (Resolves Chrome PWAs via hicolor)
- Hierarchical "Open With" submenu based on Gio.AppInfo (matching mdeon-desktop.py)
- Modular: Works across any WM, compositor, file manager, and terminal
"""

